  "vv68:1.1": "cando yathā viggatavalāhake nabhe ",
  "vv68:1.2": "obhāsayaṃ tiṭṭhati antalikkhe ",
  "vv68:1.3": "tathūpamaṃ tuyhamidaṃ vimānaṃ ",
  "vv68:1.4": "obhāsayaṃ tiṭṭhati antalikkhe ",
  "vv68:2.1": "deviddhipattosi mahānubhāvo ",
  "vv68:2.2": "manussabhūto kimakāsi puññaṃ ",
  "vv68:2.3": "kenāsi evañjalitānubhāvo ",
  "vv68:2.4": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatīti. ",
  "vv68:3.1": "so devaputto attamano moggallānena pucchito … ",
  "vv68:3.2": "pe … ",
  "vv68:3.3": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ ",
  "vv68:4.1": "ahañca bhariyā ca manussaloke ",
  "vv68:4.2": "upassayaṃ arahato adamha ",
  "vv68:4.3": "annañca pānañca pasannacittā ",
  "vv68:4.4": "sakkacca dānaṃ vipulaṃ adamha ",
  "vv68:5.1": "tena me tādiso vaṇṇo … ",
  "vv68:5.2": "pe … ",
  "vv68:5.3": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatīti. ",
  "vv68:6.1": "upassayadāyakavimānaṃ catutthaṃ. 5 "
